eWrap\">\nThe orca, or \"killer whale,\" is actually the largest species of dolphin. Adult orcas are typically 15-25 feet long and weigh 8,000-12,000 pounds Orca Companions Starting Statistics: Size Medium; Speed swim 80 ft.; AC +1 natural armor; Attack bite (1d6); Ability Scores Str 11, Dex 19, Con 10, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 6; Special Qualities low-light vision, hold breath.\n\n7th-Level Advancement: Size Large; AC +2 natural armor; Attack bite (1d8); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4; Special Qualities blindsight 120 ft.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Orca (CR 5)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 5 \nXP 1,600 \nN Huge animal  \nInit +6; Senses blindsight 120 ft., low-light vision; Perception +19   \nDefense   \nAC 16, touch 10, flat-footed 14 (+2 Dex, +6 natural, -2 size)\n\nhp 67 (9d8+27)\n\nFort +9, Ref +8, Will +5   \nOffense   \nSpd swim 80 ft. \nMelee bite +13 (2d6+12)\n\nSpace 15 ft.; Reach 10 ft.   \nStatistics   \nStr 27, Dex 15, Con 16, Int 2, Wis 15, Cha 6 \nBase Atk +6; CMB +16; CMD 28 \nFeats Endurance, Improved Initiative, Skill Focus (Perception, Swim), Weapon Focus (bite)\n\nSkills Perception +19, Swim +28; Racial Modifiers +8 Perception \nSQ hold breath (as dolphin)\n\n\n\nEcology   \nEnvironment  cold oceans \nOrganization solitary, pair, or pod (3-20)\n\nTreasure none   \nDescription\n\nThe orca, or \"killer whale,\" is actually the largest species of dolphin. Adult orcas are typically 15-25 feet long and weigh 8,000-12,000 pounds Orca Companions Starting Statistics: Size Medium; Speed swim 80 ft.; AC +1 natural armor; Attack bite (1d6); Ability Scores Str 11, Dex 19, Con 10, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 6; Special Qualities low-light vision, hold breath.\n\n7th-Level Advancement: Size Large; AC +2 natural armor; Attack bite (1d8); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4; Special Qualities blindsight 120 ft.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":5},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":9},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"rid":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"sen":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"slt":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"spl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ste":{"